{"kind":"pr","url":"https://github.com/Wealthtechinnovations/api_opcv/pull/1","repo":"Wealthtechinnovations/api_opcv","number":1,"set":"agent","source":"claude-code-open","title":"Add portfolio routes and microservices infrastructure setup","body":"## Summary\nThis PR completes the microservices architecture setup for the OPCVM platform by adding the missing portfolio service routes and establishing the foundational infrastructure for running 8 independent services alongside the existing monolith.\n\n## Key Changes\n\n### New Service Routes\n- **`services/portfolio/routes.js`** — Added 24 authenticated route stubs covering portfolio management, transactions, valuations, and favorites functionality\n- **`services/funds/routes.js`** — Added 32 authenticated route stubs for fund operations, file uploads, and anomaly detection (created in prior commit)\n\n### Infrastructure & Configuration\n- **`ecosystem.config.js`** — Created PM2 configuration to orchestrate all 8 microservices (gateway, auth, funds, performance, portfolio, analytics, reference, notification)\n- **`.env.example`** — Extended with microservices port mappings (3010-3016) and service URLs for gateway routing\n- **`package.json`** — Updated main entry point to gateway and added individual service startup scripts plus `start:services` command to launch all services\n\n### Gateway Registry Cleanup\n- **`services/gateway/serviceRegistry.js`** — Removed 5 ghost/non-existent routes (`/api/fonds`, `/api/searchFunds`, `/api/importfondsvl`, `/api/valLiq`, `/api/frais`) that were causing routing confusion\n\n## Implementation Details\n- All route handlers are authentication-protected via `authenticate` middleware\n- Portfolio routes include file upload support via multer where needed\n- Routes follow RESTful conventions with proper HTTP methods (GET for retrieval, POST for mutations)\n- Service discovery ready: gateway can route requests to individual services via environment-configured URLs\n- Backward compatibility maintained: original `app.js` monolith still available via `npm start`\n\n## Deployment Ready\nThis PR resolves the critical blocker preventing API startup (missing portfolio routes) and provides the complete infrastructure needed for Ionos deployment with PM2 process management.\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_0178s415pMBpB1Q5LrPDimwb","authorType":"User","additions":107345,"deletions":28681,"changedFiles":551,"files":[{"path":".env","additions":0,"deletions":42},{"path":".env.example","additions":47,"deletions":4},{"path":".env.production","additions":71,"deletions":0},{"path":".env.production.plan-b","additions":18,"deletions":0},{"path":".github/CODEOWNERS","additions":10,"deletions":0},{"path":".github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/bug_report.md","additions":22,"deletions":0},{"path":".github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/documentation.md","additions":18,"deletions":0},{"path":".github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/feature_request.md","additions":20,"deletions":0},{"path":".github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/incident.md","additions":42,"deletions":0},{"path":".github/PULL_REQUEST_TEMPLATE.md","additions":29,"deletions":0},{"path":".github/workflows/doc-drift.yml","additions":275,"deletions":0},{"path":".github/workflows/governance-allocation-contract.yml","additions":53,"deletions":0},{"path":".github/workflows/governance-allocation-data.yml","additions":46,"deletions":0},{"path":".github/workflows/governance-allocation-engine.yml","additions":44,"deletions":0},{"path":".github/workflows/governance-api-runtime-contract.yml","additions":41,"deletions":0},{"path":".github/workflows/governance-branch-policy.yml","additions":78,"deletions":0},{"path":".github/workflows/governance-contract.yml","additions":158,"deletions":0},{"path":".github/workflows/governance-incidents.yml","additions":34,"deletions":0},{"path":".github/workflows/governance-jwt-rotation.yml","additions":49,"deletions":0},{"path":".github/workflows/governance-markdown-audit.yml","additions":99,"deletions":0},{"path":".github/workflows/governance-mu